[Type "map"]

1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 {Najdorf Variation}
(5... e6 {Scheveningen Variation} 6. g4 {Keres Attack} (6. Be2 {Classical Variation}))
6. Be3 {English Attack} (6. Bg5 {[%course black] Main Line}) (6. Bc4 {[%course black] Fischer–Sozin Attack}) (6. Be2 {[%course black] Opočenský Variation}) (6. Bd3 {[%course black]})
6... e5 {[%course both]} (6... e6 {[%course white]}) (6... Ng4 {}) *
